{
  "_": "The telemetry contract between the app (src/Core/Telemetry.cs), the stats Worker (src/index.js, src/api.js) and the dashboard (dashboard/ui-map.js). The Worker reads this file; the app's tests (tests/TelemetryTests.cs) and the Worker's tests check their side against it. Change it here first.",
